comments":[{"author_id":"17841466461523424","author_name":"Angela.C","comment_id":"18217106260349454","comment_text":"請擇一","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/Dd6ninEmKVx","created_at":"2026-09-30 08:06:35","error":null,"like_count":0,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":0},{"author_id":"17841463176026097","author_name":"𝐀&𝐛𝐞𝐫 𝐂𝐡𝐞𝐧","comment_id":"18096163826207056","comment_text":"@_ming.1995_ 留友帶我去","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/Dd6hRXZgRqK","created_at":"2026-09-30 07:11:48","error":null,"like_count":0,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":1},{"author_id":"17841427469422943","author_name":"Meta AI","comment_id":"18143844070589257","comment_text":"這串中山區被提到最多就是中山站那一圈！\n\n最完整是有人整理的中山站美食合輯，包含 Byori、夢婆炭火小酒館、KATSU鑫熟成豬排、塩琉、木麒麟、天雞、八條老宅麻辣鍋那一整排，很多人直接收藏說要一個個吃。\n\n另外還有中山站附近的 享點港式飲茶、超平價早餐 大王漢寶殿、還有米其林必比登的有有1969 台菜，都是中山區回訪率很高的口袋名單。","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/Dd4Tda9kYEX","created_at":"2026-09-29 10:32:38","error":null,"like_count":0,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":0},{"author_id":"17841463342078827","author_name":"張艾希","comment_id":"17910677256537599","comment_text":"@meta.ai 此串中山區店家","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/Dd4TKWvD7no","created_at":"2026-09-29 10:30:02","error":null,"like_count":0,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":1},{"author_id":"17841463610897360","author_name":"Hana🐰","comment_id":"18124090282895205","comment_text":"存","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/Dd4MPRek-3y","created_at":"2026-09-29 09:29:32","error":null,"like_count":1,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":0},{"author_id":"17841462941195241","author_name":"Jil Wu","comment_id":"18133397404657777","comment_text":"1.2.9.10.都有吃過認真好吃。其他的一定要去吃吃看了","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/Dds99EXG5F0","created_at":"2026-09-25 00:53:04","error":null,"like_count":0,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":0},{"author_id":"17841427469422943","author_name":"Meta AI","comment_id":"18121407091712442","comment_text":"這篇現在有 2600 多則留言，系統抓不到完整 2632 則的全部文字，沒辦法做 100% 精準計數。\n\n從熱門留言跟我剛抓的 100 則樣本來看，重複率最高的是這幾種：火鍋類的手工殿麻辣鍋物被點名最多次，大家都說服務跟情緒價值滿分；大安區的起上小法師跟蔬食的 Sunami 蔬納米是高讚留言的常客；甜點就是 taste_buds_pursue_allen 說 99訪的那間自自。\n\n火鍋另外還有草原風蒙古火鍋、鮑福記、荖子鍋、小橘色個人鍋，日料則是肥前屋被講最多，如果要更準你直接在留言區搜關鍵字會更快。","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/Ddsp5cBCRCH","created_at":"2026-09-24 21:57:49","error":null,"like_count":4,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":0},{"author_id":"17841463186858584","author_name":"","comment_id":"18146346727515738","comment_text":"@meta.ai 整理出此篇回覆中被提及最多次的前10名口袋名單，\n謝謝","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/DdspndPk9Sn","created_at":"2026-09-24 21:55:22","error":null,"like_count":1,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":1},{"author_id":"17841469678732678","author_name":"FAN","comment_id":"17908772304517671","comment_text":"必須是@cro_fee \n悠哉的午後，必須到這裡報到","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/Ddqs7Z1E0rO","created_at":"2026-09-24 03:45:49","error":null,"like_count":0,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":0},{"author_id":"17841427469422943","author_name":"Meta AI","comment_id":"18107785148187296","comment_text":"幫你把這串的台北日料重點整理好了，都是被N刷的等級：\n\n1. 高CP無菜單：金彩真 日本料理，板前全套含前菜、生魚片、握壽司到甜點才1500，比普遍3000-4000的omakase親民超多。\n2. 午餐偷吃高級店：游壽司、九井、Maru這種晚餐2500起跳的，改吃午間定食或丼飯800-1500就能吃到，省超大。\n3. 居酒屋常客：赤綠，我自己最常去的，清爽的皿壽司跟番茄冷湯麵超適合夏天，週末還有DJ場。","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/DdqZk8Hkxsx","created_at":"2026-09-24 00:56:43","error":null,"like_count":0,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":0},{"author_id":"17841467478051221","author_name":"陳韋霖","comment_id":"18209794996364419","comment_text":"@meta.ai 整理日料並且在台北的","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/DdqZhtJFMnO","created_at":"2026-09-24 00:56:17","error":null,"like_count":0,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":1},{"author_id":"17841463577111588","author_name":"Alec Tsai","comment_id":"17968834218157495","comment_text":"","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/DdqBIvxmAqU","created_at":"2026-09-23 21:23:10","error":null,"like_count":3,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":0},{"author_id":"17841427469422943","author_name":"Meta AI","comment_id":"18421580440153408","comment_text":"目前這篇有2628則留言，系統抓不到完整清單，只能從熱門樣本看趨勢。\n\n高讚留言裡重複率最高的是你看到的那幾間：大安區的 起上小法師、蔬食的 Sunami 蔬納米，還有 taste_buds_pursue_allen 說99訪的那間甜點店，大家一直敲碗水蜜桃杯。\n\n如果要精準統計，最快的方法是你進原串用關鍵字搜餐廳名，留言區現在火鍋、甜點、小吃這三類洗版最多。","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/DdonyYZk65i","created_at":"2026-09-23 08:22:25","error":null,"like_count":0,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":0},{"author_id":"17841467416613959","author_name":"河河記事本","comment_id":"18087973466300512","comment_text":"@meta.ai 幫我整理出最多人提到的餐廳","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/Ddond1ylJi2","created_at":"2026-09-23 08:19:36","error":null,"like_count":1,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":1},{"author_id":"17841472943269122","author_name":"風日洋食 （かぜ日のブランチ）","comment_id":"18176519428445817","comment_text":"位於板橋新埔站附近的日式洋食餐廳，店內充滿宮崎駿擺設及可愛吉卜力風格元素，好吃又好拍。人氣咖哩蛋包飯、蕃茄洋葱蛋包飯、特色定食套餐、兒童餐、日式簡餐、素食(蛋奶素)、日式茶飲、早午餐、下午茶、晚餐及特色鮮奶麻吉、銅鑼燒堡、日式蕨餅、手作點心及各式飲料提供選擇，慶生還會有送甜點蠟燭祝賀喔！\n\n風日洋食\n地址：新北市板橋區文化路一段270巷3號1樓\n（新埔站2號出口走路約200米）\n營業時間：11:00-20:00（周一公休）\n訂位電話：02-22540378\n線上訂位：Google地圖可預約訂位","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/Ddjemh1GIdJ","created_at":"2026-09-21 08:25:57","error":null,"like_count":2,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":0},{"author_id":"17841467706967198","author_name":"周 政宏","comment_id":"17974588454932758","comment_text":"留自己看","comment_url":"https://www.threads.net/t/DdiSqDbkbga","created_at":"2026-09-20 21:22:20","error":null,"like_count":0,"platform":"THREADS","post_id":"18113719412301018","reply_count":0},{"author_id":"17841467585713821","author_name":"布娜飛比利時啤酒餐廳"